{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/咒刃·渊狱","pageid":5793,"revid":13565,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%C2%B7%E6%B8%8A%E7%8B%B1&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%C2%B7%E6%B8%8A%E7%8B%B1&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%C2%B7%E6%B8%8A%E7%8B%B1&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>咒刃·渊狱</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.92.92.E5.88.83.C2.B7.E6.B8.8A.E7.8B.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"咒刃·渊狱\"><b>咒刃·渊狱</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 咒刃渊狱.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/4h7dafd5t0ywfp0mtapchd4vv40nxat.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%E6%B8%8A%E7%8B%B1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/4h7dafd5t0ywfp0mtapchd4vv40nxat.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%E6%B8%8A%E7%8B%B1.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f9/4h7dafd5t0ywfp0mtapchd4vv40nxat.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />咒刃·渊狱\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3圈\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）进行1次攻击，依次对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1、2、3</font>圈内所有敌人，分别造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">60%</font>伤害，再施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×受治疗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×受治疗</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×属性增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×属性增益</font></span></span>],持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。攻击前，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"潜能激发·咒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">潜能激发·咒</font></span></span>]，持续2回合;攻击后，若目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]状态则对其额外施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×不屈</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，及施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"晕眩\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">晕眩</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 3圈.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e3/bgmvxupdecqchw1lo64obouvgb8egqm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_3%E5%9C%88.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"77\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e3/bgmvxupdecqchw1lo64obouvgb8egqm.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_3%E5%9C%88.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e3/bgmvxupdecqchw1lo64obouvgb8egqm.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_3%E5%9C%88.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"163\" data-file-height=\"157\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%B8%95%E8%A5%BF%E6%B3%95%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/帕西法尔\"><img alt=\"头像 帕西法尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/i